    "newton": "converged = bool(rel < 1e-9) becomes bool(rel < 1e-9 AND gauge_defect <= gauge_tol), with gauge_defect = max(|Omega(theta=0)+1|, |Omega(X~1)+1/2|) -- the two rows F[J], F[J+1] the method already builds and previously discarded. Absolute and degree-1 homogeneous, so it is exactly the companion rel cannot be. New keys: converged_relres_only (the pre-repair flag, unchanged), gauge_ok, gauge_defect, reason.",
